    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d628">

                <pb facs="0799" n="705" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg705"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Rockhill to Mr.
                            Lee.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi></placeName>,<lb/><date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1896-08-20"><hi rendition="#italic">August
                                20, 1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Replying your cable of yesterday in reference Charles Govin, you are instructed
                    to demand of Captain-General full information. In case Govin still alive insist
                    on his enjoying full treaty rights under paragraph 2 or 3 of protocol of 77, as
                    case may be.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rockhill</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
